The WorkSuite repository (worksuite.list.*) is used only with WORKSUITE_REPO=1, once the repository exists and
packaging/keyring/worksuite-archive-keyring.gpg holds its public key (tools/repo/README.md). The key reaches devices in
worksuite-archive-keyring at /usr/share/keyrings/worksuite-archive-keyring.gpg; for the image build itself, also copy it
here as worksuite.key.chroot and worksuite.key.binary.
